<Document
  title="A quiet visit."
  label="Privacy"
  description="How this site handles your visit: no analytics scripts, no advertising cookies, and one optional local motion preference."
>
  <h2>What this site stores</h2>
  <p>
    This edition has no accounts, contact forms, advertising scripts or
    analytics trackers. If you pause the atmosphere, the site stores one
    preference in your browser: <code>cone-motion</code>. It stays on your
    device and is not sent to a project database.
  </p>
  <p>
    The site respects your device’s reduced-motion preference. If browser
    storage is blocked, the motion control still works for the current page.
  </p>
  <h2>Hosting and external services</h2>
  <p>
    Our hosting provider processes requests to serve and protect the site. Those
    requests may include technical information such as IP address, browser
    details and requested page. This edition does not copy those logs into an
    analytics service.
  </p>
  <p>
    Links to GitHub take you to a separate service with its own privacy
    practices. Your activity there is governed by that service and your account
    settings. Fonts and gallery images are served from this website.
  </p>
  <h2>Future changes</h2>
  <p>
    Any future analytics or community accounts will require an updated policy
    before activation. The current site does not load a dormant tracker.
  </p>
  <p class="privacy-date">Last updated: 11 September 2026</p>
</Document>
